{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52323","headline":"诗（幷序） 八十四 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 八十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谗臣乱人国，姡妇破人家。\n客到双[眉]（媚）肿，夫来两手㧝（项、戴校「拏」）。\n丑皮不忧敌，面面却憎花。\n亲姻共欢乐，夫妇作荣花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52323.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52323","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}